@host = http://localhost:5080
@email = cliente-http@tests.local
@password = Senha12345

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness (postgres, redis, mongo)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Versão
GET {{host}}/api/v1/system/version

### Versão com correlation id (procure no Mongo: db.logs.find({ correlationId: "teste-manual-1" }))
GET {{host}}/api/v1/system/version
X-Correlation-Id: teste-manual-1

### Cadastro
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Cliente HTTP", "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Meu perfil
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Renovar tokens
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}" }

### Sair
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}" }

### ---------- Admin ----------
### Preencha com Seed:AdminEmail e Seed:AdminPassword de appsettings.Development.json
@adminEmail = admin@littleecommerce.local
@adminPassword = troque-pela-senha-do-seed

### Login do admin
# @name admin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

### Listar usuários (users.read)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users?search=tests.local&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Papéis e permissões (roles.read)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Catálogo de permissões (roles.read)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Criar papel (roles.manage)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Auditor", "description": "Só lê a auditoria", "permissions": ["audit.read"] }

### Auditoria (audit.read)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/audit-logs?kind=admin-action&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Outbox: resumo por status (outbox.read)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/outbox/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Outbox: mensagens em dead-letter (outbox.read)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/outbox?status=DeadLetter
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Outbox: reenviar tudo que está em dead-letter (outbox.manage)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/outbox/retry-dead-letters
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### ---------- Catálogo ----------
### Categorias
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories

### Produtos: busca, faixa de preço, em estoque, mais baratos primeiro
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products?search=fone&minPrice=100&maxPrice=1000&inStock=true&sort=PriceAsc&limit=10

### Produtos de uma categoria (slug)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products?category=acessorios

### Detalhe por slug
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products/notebook-ultra-14

### Componentes do kit
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products/kit-home-office/links?type=Kit

### Criar produto (catalog.manage)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "webcam-fhd", "name": "Webcam Full HD", "price": 299.90, "compareAtPrice": 349.90, "stock": 12 }
